ce":[{"where":"The Most Ethical Path","quote":"In late 2023, the Health Services Safety Investigations Body (HSSIB) investigated a series ofIT system failures in NHS hospitals across England."},{"where":"The Most Ethical Path","quote":"In the case of the Volkswagen emissions scandal, it was discovered that Volkswagen had installed “defeat devices”"}],"reasoning":"Case studies (NHS IT failures, VW emissions) are integrated alongside the Engineers Australia code. However, the evidence base is somewhat light (4 references), and the VW case is described inaccurately as manipulating electric vehicle crash-safety tests rather than diesel emissions."},{"id":"C5","level":"Good","mark":6,"evidence":[{"where":"ETHICS REPORT: To Ship or Not to Ship","quote":"ETHICS REPORT: To Ship or Not to Ship"}],"reasoning":"The writing is clear and structured logically, but the required ~150-word abstract is completely missing. Additionally, no visual elements (tables, figures, or diagrams) are included."}],"requirements":[{"id":"R1","met":"yes","where":"DICUSSION: To Ship or Not to Ship"},{"id":"R2","met":"yes","where":"The Most Ethical Path"},{"id":"R3","met":"yes","where":"DICUSSION: To Ship or Not to Ship"},{"id":"R4","met":"yes","where":"The Most Ethical Path"},{"id":"R5","met":"yes","where":"DICUSSION: To Ship or Not to Ship"},{"id":"R6","met":"yes","where":"The Most Ethical Path"},{"id":"R7","met":"yes","where":"RECOMMENDATION"}],"technical_issues":[{"where":"DICUSSION: To Ship or Not to Ship","issue":"Incorrect percentage calculation: 1 percent of 5,000 servers is 50 servers, not 500."},{"where":"The Most Ethical Path","issue":"Factual error regarding external case study: Volkswagen installed defeat devices to cheat diesel emissions testing, not 'manipulate crash-safety tests' in 'electric vehicles'."}],"overall":"A well-argued submission with balanced stakeholder analysis and relevant engineering codes. However, it lacks the required abstract and visual figures, contains factual/arithmetic errors (VW case details and server percentage calculation), and presents an ambiguous first recommendation regarding accepting the contract."}
